{"page":131,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:28","surah":6,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ بَدَا لَهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يُخْفُونَ مِن قَبْلُ ۖ وَلَوْ رُدُّوا۟ لَعَادُوا۟ لِمَا نُهُوا۟ عَنْهُ وَإِنَّهُمْ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No! The truth they used to hide will become all too clear to them. Even if they were brought back, they would only return to the very thing that was forbidden to them- they are such liars!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَدَا","en_gloss":"became manifest","transliteration":"badā","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُخْفُونَ","en_gloss":"conceal","transliteration":"yukh'fūna","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَبْلُ ۖ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رُدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"they were sent back","transliteration":"ruddū","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَعَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"certainly they (would) return","transliteration":"laʿādū","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِمَا","en_gloss":"to what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نُهُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were forbidden","transliteration":"nuhū","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَنْهُ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"ʿanhu","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"and indeed they","transliteration":"wa-innahum","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"certainly are liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","verse_key":"6:28"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:28"}]},{"verse_key":"6:29","surah":6,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنْ هِىَ إِلَّا حَيَاتُنَا ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمَبْعُوثِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘There is nothing beyond our life in this world: we shall not be raised from the dead.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And they said","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"it (is)","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَيَاتُنَا","en_gloss":"our life","transliteration":"ḥayātunā","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"we","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِمَبْعُوثِينَ","en_gloss":"(will be) resurrected","transliteration":"bimabʿūthīna","verse_key":"6:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:29"}]},{"verse_key":"6:30","surah":6,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ تَرَىٰٓ إِذْ وُقِفُوا۟ عَلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ ۚ قَالَ أَلَيْسَ هَـٰذَا بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ قَالُوا۟ بَلَىٰ وَرَبِّنَا ۚ قَالَ فَذُوقُوا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you could only see, when they are made to stand before their Lord, how He will say, ‘Is this not real?’ They will say, ‘Yes indeed, by our Lord.’ He will say, ‘Then taste the torment for having disbelieved.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"you (could) see","transliteration":"tarā","verse_key":"6:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"6:30"},{"p