h their Lord until, when the Hour suddenly arrives, they say, ‘Alas for us that we disregarded this!’ They will bear their burdens on their backs. How terrible those burdens will be!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَسِرَ","en_gloss":"incurred loss","transliteration":"khasira","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِلِقَآءِ","en_gloss":"in (the) meeting","transliteration":"biliqāi","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(with) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāathumu","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَغْتَةًۭ","en_gloss":"suddenly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَـٰحَسْرَتَنَا","en_gloss":"Oh! Our regret","transliteration":"yāḥasratanā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَرَّطْنَا","en_gloss":"we neglected","transliteration":"farraṭnā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"concerning it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"6:31"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَحْمِلُونَ","en_gloss":"will bear","transliteration":"yaḥmilūna